tags: next-history undo

=== next-at-history-end-preserves-undo
--- script
add_history "first"
readline "> "
--- keys
ab\C-n\C-_<dump>\r

=== next-past-saved-line-preserves-undo
--- script
add_history "first"
readline "> "
--- keys
ab\C-p\C-n\C-n\C-_<dump>\r

=== vi-next-at-end-preserves-undo
--- inputrc
set editing-mode vi
--- script
readline "> "
--- keys
7d\e<pause>A<bs>\e<pause>ju<dump>\r
